      "writtenOn": "2022-08-12T15:26:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Alright, I removed the default parameters on the PaintParams constructor that takes in all the values directly.\n\nI differentiated between the blenders in the constructor by naming what was previously \"blender\" -\u003e \"finalBlender\"... do you think it makes sense to also change the member attribute name from fBlender to fFinalBlender (and therefore blender() -\u003e finalBlender(), etc.?)",
      "parentUuid": "773a6338_0b14430a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 31,
        "startChar": 22,
        "endLine": 31,
        "endChar": 31
      },
      "revId": "189cc7b9dbe896dd2fdd1aa324776e9353f3cd8e",
