      "writtenOn": "2022-08-12T20:50:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah I think so. Originally, it was just blender() to correspond with the naming from SkPaint. At the SkPaint level there is only one blender to worry about, but PaintParams is aggregating a few other sources, so I think it makes sense that we can refine that name to emphasize it\u0027s the final blend.\n\nAn argument could be made that \"blender\" and \"primitiveBlender\" are disambiguated enough, but I like being explicit.",
      "parentUuid": "220f3844_807996a6",
      "range": {
